  "description": "Renders an Etymon Schema as SQL: a table model, a diff between two committed snapshots, and a migration script for PostgreSQL or SQLite. A sibling of Etymon.Schema.OpenApi and Etymon.Schema.TypeScript -- one Schema, several renderings. The output is a reviewed file, so the package carries no database driver and no runner. Ambiguous mappings are errors rather than guesses, and destructive changes are flagged rather than emitted silently.",
